              "Sharp declines in technology stocks see Dow fall 831 points or 3.1%, while Nasdaq drops more than 4%\n\nSkip to main content Skip to navigation\n\nTraders on the floor of the NYSE. After a long stretch of relative calm, the stock market has suffered sharp losses over the last week as bond yields surged",
